    {
      "key": "seo_default_description_bm",
      "value": "ATORA AIR COND & ELECTRICAL SDN. BHD. ialah pakar aircond Utara Malaysia berasaskan Kedah dan Midea Pro Shop. Kami membekalkan penyaman udara, penyelesaian borong dan alat ganti — Midea, Daikin, Panasonic, AUX, Acson, Haier, Hisense, TCL dan lain-lain — kepada pelanggan di Padang Serai, Kulim, Sungai Petani, Alor Setar serta seluruh Malaysia."
    },
    {
      "key": "seo_default_description_en",
      "value": "ATORA AIR COND & ELECTRICAL SDN. BHD. (东京冷气电器有限公司) is a Kedah-based Northern Malaysia aircond specialist and Midea Pro Shop. We supply air conditioners, wholesale solutions and spare parts — Midea, Daikin, Panasonic, AUX, Acson, Haier, Hisense, TCL and more — serving Padang Serai, Kulim, Sungai Petani, Alor Setar and customers across Malaysia."
    },
    {
      "key": "seo_default_description_zh",
      "value": "ATORA AIR COND & ELECTRICAL SDN. BHD.（东京冷气电器有限公司）是位于吉打州的北马专业冷气专门店，亦是 Midea Pro Shop。我们供应冷气机、批发方案与零件 —— Midea、Daikin、Panasonic、AUX、Acson、Haier、Hisense、TCL 等品牌 —— 服务 Padang Serai、Kulim、Sungai Petani、Alor Setar 及全马来西亚客户。"
    },
